  "anthem": {
    "link": "https://anthem.eurth.org/#example-calderwyn",
    "updated": "2026-11-13T21:05:44.000Z",
    "title": "Lanterns on the Water",
    "lyrics": "Where the Calder meets the morning\nAnd the harbour bells begin,\nEvery lantern keeps its promise:\nGuide the weary sailor in.\n\nFrom the uplands to the tide-line,\nField and ferry, hearth and quay,\nOne the light and one the river,\nCalderwyn, we sing to thee."
